` + (prompt || "Provide an overview of this repository.") + `

When done, call set_output with your answer, relevantFiles (absolute paths), and cloneDir: "` + cloneDir + '".'
      },
      includeToolCall: !1
    };
    yield "STEP_ALL";
  }

